### ============================================
### ShurYan Backend - Test HTTP Requests
### ============================================
### استخدم الملف ده عشان تختبر كل الـ Endpoints
### في VS Code: اضغط "Send Request" فوق كل request
### ============================================

@baseUrl = https://localhost:7001
@accessToken = 
@refreshToken = 
@patientId = 
@pharmacyId = 

### ============================================
### 1. AUTH CONTROLLER - Registration
### ============================================

### 1.1 Register Patient (Success Case)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register/patient
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "patient.test@shuryan.com",
  "password": "Test123!@#",
  "firstName": "Ahmed",
  "lastName": "Mohamed",
  "phoneNumber": "01234567890",
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-01-01"
}

### 1.2 Register Patient (Duplicate Email - Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register/patient
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "patient.test@shuryan.com",
  "password": "Test123!@#",
  "firstName": "Mohamed",
  "lastName": "Ali",
  "phoneNumber": "01098765432",
  "dateOfBirth": "1992-05-15"
}

### 1.3 Register Doctor
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register/doctor
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "doctor.test@shuryan.com",
  "password": "Test123!@#",
  "firstName": "Dr. Khaled",
  "lastName": "Hassan",
  "phoneNumber": "01111222333",
  "specialization": "Cardiology",
  "licenseNumber": "DOC123456"
}

### 1.4 Register Pharmacy
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register/pharmacy
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "pharmacy.test@shuryan.com",
  "password": "Test123!@#",
  "pharmacyName": "الشفاء الصيدلية",
  "phoneNumber": "01555666777",
  "licenseNumber": "PHARM789012"
}

### ============================================
### 2. AUTH CONTROLLER - Email Verification
### ============================================

### 2.1 Verify Email with OTP
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "patient.test@shuryan.com",
  "otp": "123456"
}

### 2.2 Resend Verification OTP
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/resend-verification
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "patient.test@shuryan.com"
}

### ============================================
### 3. AUTH CONTROLLER - Login
### ============================================

### 3.1 Login (Success Case)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "patient.test@shuryan.com",
  "password": "Test123!@#"
}

### 3.2 Login (Wrong Password - Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "patient.test@shuryan.com",
  "password": "WrongPassword123"
}

### 3.3 Google Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/google-login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idToken": "google-id-token-here",
  "userType": "Patient"
}

### ============================================
### 4. AUTH CONTROLLER - Password Management
### ============================================

### 4.1 Forgot Password (Request OTP)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "patient.test@shuryan.com"
}

### 4.2 Reset Password with OTP
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "patient.test@shuryan.com",
  "otp": "654321",
  "newPassword": "NewPass123!@#"
}

### 4.3 Change Password (Requires Auth)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/change-password
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "oldPassword": "Test123!@#",
  "newPassword": "NewPass456!@#"
}

### ============================================
### 5. AUTH CONTROLLER - Token Management
### ============================================

### 5.1 Refresh Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### 5.2 Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### ============================================
### 6. AUTH CONTROLLER - User Info
### ============================================

### 6.1 Get Current User
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ============================================
### 7. PATIENTS CONTROLLER - Basic CRUD
### ============================================

### 7.1 Get Patient by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/{{patientId}}

### 7.2 Create Patient
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "user-guid-here",
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-01-01",
  "gender": "Male",
  "bloodType": "O+",
  "height": 175.5,
  "weight": 70.0,
  "emergencyContactName": "Mohamed Ali",
  "emergencyContactPhone": "01234567890"
}

### 7.3 Update Patient
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/{{patientId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "height": 176.0,
  "weight": 72.0,
  "emergencyContactName": "Mohamed Ali Updated",
  "emergencyContactPhone": "01234567890"
}

### 7.4 Delete Patient (Soft Delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/{{patientId}}

### 7.5 Restore Deleted Patient
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/{{patientId}}/restore

### ============================================
### 8. PATIENTS CONTROLLER - Query Operations
### ============================================

### 8.1 Get Patient by Email
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/email/patient.test@shuryan.com

### 8.2 Get All Patients
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients?includeDeleted=false

### 8.3 Get Paginated Patients
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/paginated?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10

### 8.4 Search Patients
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "searchTerm": "Ahmed",
  "gender": "Male",
  "bloodType": "O+",
  "pageNumber": 1,
  "pageSize": 10
}

### 8.5 Get Patients with Medical History
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/with-medical-history

### 8.6 Check Email Unique
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/check-email/newpatient@test.com

### 8.7 Get Total Patients Count
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/count?includeDeleted=false

### ============================================
### 9. PATIENTS CONTROLLER - Medical History
### ============================================

### 9.1 Get Patient Medical History
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/{{patientId}}/medical-history

### 9.2 Add Medical History Item
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/{{patientId}}/medical-history
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "condition": "Diabetes Type 2",
  "diagnosisDate": "2020-05-15",
  "treatment": "Metformin 500mg twice daily",
  "notes": "Patient needs regular blood sugar monitoring"
}

### 9.3 Update Medical History Item
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/{{patientId}}/medical-history/item-guid-here
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "treatment": "Metformin 850mg twice daily",
  "notes": "Dosage increased due to high HbA1c"
}

### 9.4 Delete Medical History Item
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/{{patientId}}/medical-history/item-guid-here

### ============================================
### 10. PATIENTS CONTROLLER - Appointments
### ============================================

### 10.1 Get All Appointments
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/{{patientId}}/appointments

### 10.2 Get Upcoming Appointments
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/{{patientId}}/appointments/upcoming

### 10.3 Get Past Appointments
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/{{patientId}}/appointments/past

### 10.4 Get Next Appointment
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/{{patientId}}/appointments/next

### 10.5 Get Appointments Count
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/{{patientId}}/appointments/count

### ============================================
### 11. PATIENTS CONTROLLER - Prescriptions
### ============================================

### 11.1 Get All Prescriptions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/{{patientId}}/prescriptions

### 11.2 Get Active Prescriptions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/{{patientId}}/prescriptions/active

### 11.3 Get Specific Prescription
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/{{patientId}}/prescriptions/prescription-guid-here

### ============================================
### 12. PATIENTS CONTROLLER - Lab Orders
### ============================================

### 12.1 Get All Lab Orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/{{patientId}}/lab-orders

### 12.2 Get Pending Lab Orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/{{patientId}}/lab-orders/pending

### 12.3 Get Specific Lab Order
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/{{patientId}}/lab-orders/order-guid-here

### ============================================
### 13. PATIENTS CONTROLLER - Address
### ============================================

### 13.1 Get Patient Address
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/{{patientId}}/address

### 13.2 Update Patient Address
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/{{patientId}}/address
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "street": "123 Main Street",
  "city": "Cairo",
  "governorate": "Cairo",
  "postalCode": "11511",
  "latitude": 30.0444,
  "longitude": 31.2357
}

### 13.3 Create Patient Address
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/address
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "{{patientId}}",
  "street": "456 New Street",
  "city": "Giza",
  "governorate": "Giza",
  "postalCode": "12345",
  "latitude": 30.0131,
  "longitude": 31.2089
}

### ============================================
### 14. PATIENTS CONTROLLER - Profile
### ============================================

### 14.1 Update Profile Image
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/{{patientId}}/profile-image
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "imageUrl": "https://example.com/images/patient-profile.jpg"
}

### 14.2 Remove Profile Image
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/{{patientId}}/profile-image

### ============================================
### 15. PHARMACIES CONTROLLER - Profile
### ============================================

### 15.1 Get Pharmacy by ID
GET {{http://localhost:5117}}/api/pharmacies/{{42f132b1-e21d-4738-9324-2ba9f2be71bd}}

### 15.2 Get Pharmacy by Email
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pharmacies/email/pharmacy.test@shuryan.com

### 15.3 Get Current Pharmacy (Requires Auth)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pharmacies/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 15.4 Update Current Pharmacy
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/pharmacies/me
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "pharmacyName": "الشفاء الصيدلية - Updated",
  "phoneNumber": "01555666777",
  "description": "صيدلية متكاملة تقدم جميع الخدمات الصيدلانية"
}

### ============================================
### 16. PHARMACIES CONTROLLER - Working Hours
### ============================================

### 16.1 Get Working Hours
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pharmacies/{{pharmacyId}}/working-hours

### 16.2 Add Working Hours
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pharmacies/{{pharmacyId}}/working-hours
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "dayOfWeek": "Monday",
  "openTime": "09:00:00",
  "closeTime": "21:00:00",
  "is24Hours": false
}

### 16.3 Update Working Hours
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/pharmacies/{{pharmacyId}}/working-hours/hours-guid-here
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "openTime": "08:00:00",
  "closeTime": "22:00:00",
  "is24Hours": false
}

### 16.4 Delete Working Hours
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/pharmacies/{{pharmacyId}}/working-hours/hours-guid-here
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 16.5 Check if Pharmacy is Open
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pharmacies/{{pharmacyId}}/is-open

### ============================================
### 17. PHARMACIES CONTROLLER - Orders
### ============================================

### 17.1 Get All Orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pharmacies/{{pharmacyId}}/orders?pageNumber=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 17.2 Get Specific Order
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pharmacies/{{pharmacyId}}/orders/order-guid-here
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 17.3 Accept Order
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/pharmacies/{{pharmacyId}}/orders/order-guid-here/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 17.4 Reject Order
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/pharmacies/{{pharmacyId}}/orders/order-guid-here/reject
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "rejectionReason": "Out of stock for some medications"
}

### 17.5 Mark Order as Preparing
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/pharmacies/{{pharmacyId}}/orders/order-guid-here/prepare
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 17.6 Mark Order as Ready
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/pharmacies/{{pharmacyId}}/orders/order-guid-here/ready
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 17.7 Dispatch Order
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/pharmacies/{{pharmacyId}}/orders/order-guid-here/dispatch
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 17.8 Mark Order as Delivered
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/pharmacies/{{pharmacyId}}/orders/order-guid-here/deliver
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 17.9 Get Pending Orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pharmacies/{{pharmacyId}}/orders/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 17.10 Get In-Progress Orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pharmacies/{{pharmacyId}}/orders/in-progress
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 17.11 Get Completed Orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pharmacies/{{pharmacyId}}/orders/completed
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ============================================
### 18. PHARMACIES CONTROLLER - Search
### ============================================

### 18.1 Search Pharmacies
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pharmacies/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "الشفاء",
  "governorate": "Cairo",
  "isOpen": true,
  "isVerified": true,
  "pageNumber": 1,
  "pageSize": 10
}

### 18.2 Get Pharmacies by Governorate
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pharmacies/governorate/Cairo

### 18.3 Get Nearby Pharmacies
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pharmacies/nearby?latitude=30.0444&longitude=31.2357&radiusKm=5

### ============================================
### 19. PHARMACIES CONTROLLER - Documents
### ============================================

### 19.1 Get Pharmacy Documents
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pharmacies/{{pharmacyId}}/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 19.2 Upload Document
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pharmacies/{{pharmacyId}}/documents
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "documentType": "License",
  "documentUrl": "https://example.com/documents/pharmacy-license.pdf",
  "expiryDate": "2025-12-31"
}

### ============================================
### 20. PHARMACIES CONTROLLER - Reviews
### ============================================

### 20.1 Get Pharmacy Reviews
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pharmacies/{{pharmacyId}}/reviews

### 20.2 Get Review Statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pharmacies/{{pharmacyId}}/reviews/statistics

### ============================================
### 21. PHARMACIES CONTROLLER - Verification
### ============================================

### 21.1 Get Pending Verification Pharmacies (Admin/Verifier)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pharmacies/pending-verification
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 21.2 Verify Pharmacy (Admin/Verifier)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pharmacies/{{pharmacyId}}/verify
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "verificationNotes": "All documents verified successfully"
}

### 21.3 Reject Verification (Admin/Verifier)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pharmacies/{{pharmacyId}}/reject-verification
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "rejectionReason": "License document is expired"
}

### ============================================
### NOTES:
### ============================================
### 1. استبدل {{baseUrl}} بالـ URL الفعلي للـ API
### 2. بعد Login، احفظ الـ accessToken و refreshToken في المتغيرات
### 3. استبدل {{patientId}} و {{pharmacyId}} بالـ IDs الفعلية
### 4. بعض الـ Endpoints تحتاج Authorization (Bearer Token)
### 5. استخدم الـ HTTP file ده في VS Code مع REST Client Extension
### ============================================
